
#  Retail Sales Analysis Dashboard

##  Objective

Analyze the Superstore Sales Dataset using Python and Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) to identify sales trends, evaluate business performance, and generate actionable business insights.

##  Dataset

**Superstore Sales Dataset**

##  Tools Used

* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* Seaborn

##  Project Workflow

* Data Import
* Data Cleaning
* Filtering and Sorting
* Statistical Analysis
* Sales and Profit Analysis
* Region-wise Analysis
* Category-wise Analysis
* Data Visualization
* Executive Summary & Recommendations

##  Concepts Covered

* Pandas
* NumPy
* Statistics
* GroupBy
* Data Visualization
* Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)

##  Files Included

* Jupyter Notebook (.ipynb)
* Dataset (.csv)
* README.md
* EDA Report
* Screenshots

##  Key Highlights

* Imported and cleaned the retail sales dataset.
* Performed filtering and sorting to analyze business performance.
* Calculated sales and profit statistics.
* Analyzed region-wise and category-wise sales performance.
* Used GroupBy operations for data aggregation.
* Created bar charts, line charts, histograms, and scatter plots.
* Generated business insights and recommendations based on the analysis.

